<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Now through His life we have the flow,</l><l>Showing us the way to go;</l><l>Keeping us in unity,</l><l>And this is His recovery.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now Jesus is the Lord of all;</l><l>On His name we all must call.</l><l>Then our spirits find release,</l><l>And thus our hearts have found real peace.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
